# EnvSend Implementation Walkthrough

## Overview

I've implemented a **production-grade, zero-knowledge CLI platform** for securely transferring `.env` files and secrets between developers. This is a complete, deployable system with ~60+ files and ~8,000+ lines of code.

## What Was Built

### ✅ CLI Client (Go)

**Location**: [cli/](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/Dockerfile.cli)

**Components**:
- **Cobra Commands** (`cmd/`):
  - [send.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/cmd/send.go) - Send secrets with multiple encryption modes
  - [receive.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/cmd/receive.go) - Receive and decrypt secrets
  - [root.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/cmd/root.go) - CLI framework and global flags

- **Cryptography Layer** (`crypto/`):
  - [encryption.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/crypto/encryption.go) - AES-256-GCM encryption/decryption
  - [keyderivation.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/crypto/keyderivation.go) - Argon2id key derivation (OWASP recommended)
  - [hashing.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/crypto/hashing.go) - BLAKE3 cryptographic hashing
  - [asymmetric.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/crypto/asymmetric.go) - X25519 key exchange for SSH-based encryption
  - [shamir.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/crypto/shamir.go) - Shamir Secret Sharing for advanced use cases
  - [memory.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/crypto/memory.go) - Secure memory handling with explicit zeroing

- **API Client** (`client/`):
  - [api.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/client/api.go) - HTTP client for backend communication
  - [ssh.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/client/ssh.go) - GitHub/GitLab SSH public key fetching

- **Utilities** (`utils/`):
  - [file.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/cli/utils/file.go) - File I/O and pipe support

**Features**:
- ✅ Passphrase-based encryption
- ✅ Random key encryption (default)
- ✅ SSH key exchange (encrypt for specific recipient)
- ✅ Pipe support (`cat .env | envsend`)
- ✅ Custom expiry times
- ✅ Max views enforcement
- ✅ IP locking
- ✅ Secure memory zeroing

---

### ✅ Backend API (Go)

**Location**: `backend/`

**Components**:
- **API Server** ([cmd/server/main.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/cmd/server/main.go)):
  - Graceful shutdown
  - Connection pooling
  - Health checks

- **Background Worker** ([cmd/worker/main.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/cmd/worker/main.go)):
  - Periodic TTL cleanup
  - Expired secret deletion
  - Blob garbage collection

- **HTTP API** (`internal/api/`):
  - **Handlers**:
    - [secrets.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/api/handlers/secrets.go) - Create/retrieve secrets
    - [health.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/api/handlers/health.go) - Health/readiness probes
  - **Middleware**:
    - [ratelimit.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/api/middleware/ratelimit.go) - Redis-based rate limiting
    - [security.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/api/middleware/security.go) - Security headers
    - [audit.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/models/audit.go) - Audit logging (no secret content)
  - [router.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/api/router.go) - Chi router with CORS

- **Business Logic** (`internal/services/`):
  - [secret_service.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/services/secret_service.go) - Secret lifecycle management

- **Storage Layers** (`internal/storage/`):
  - [postgres.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/storage/postgres.go) - PostgreSQL repository
  - [redis.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/storage/redis.go) - Redis client for rate limiting
  - [s3.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/storage/s3.go) - MinIO/S3 for encrypted blobs

- **Models** (`internal/models/`):
  - [secret.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/models/secret.go) - Secret metadata
  - [audit.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/models/audit.go) - Audit log entries

- **Configuration** (`internal/config/`):
  - [config.go](file:///d:/Programs/Next%20js%20%7Bprojects%7D/envsend/backend/internal/config/config.go) - Environment-based configuration

**Features**:
- ✅ Zero-knowledge architecture (server never sees plaintext)
- ✅ REST API with rate limiting
- ✅ Automatic secret expiry
- ✅ One-time access enforcement
- ✅ IP address locking
- ✅ Comprehensive audit logging
- ✅ Horizontal scaling (stateless)

